#
# Opt-in x86-64-v3 (Haswell / Excavator / Zen+ and newer).
#
# Unlocks AVX2, FMA, BMI1, BMI2, LZCNT, POPCNT, MOVBE, and SSE4.1/4.2 for both
# the kernel (integer BMI/LZCNT/MOVBE) and userspace (compositor, audio, lib.c).
# Compose after arch/x64 when building for modern dedicated hardware:
#
#       sh build.sh --arch x64 v3 ...
#

#> kernel_cflags -march=x86-64-v3
#> program_flags -march=x86-64-v3 -falign-functions=32 -falign-loops=16 -falign-jumps=16
